# A pulse launched at one end either dies there or travels the whole chain: there is a critical coupling, near 0.0419 for this laser. Above it the delay per site shortens as the coupling grows.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Chain of 8, coupling 0.04
sites 8
path 1 8 kappa=0.04
kick 1 amplitude=2
run 2500
expect total 1
expect last 12.74573 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 12.74573 0.003
expect peak 1 58.449838 2e-4
expect count 2 0
expect count 3 0
expect count 4 0
expect count 5 0
expect count 6 0
expect count 7 0
expect count 8 0
expect fired 1 yes
expect silent 2 8
